usage: rebis.biology [-h] [--file FILE] [--stdin] COMMAND ...

rebis.biology — Biological Simulations & Telomere Design

positional arguments:
  COMMAND               Sub-command (run with COMMAND --help for details)
    sim                 Run OuroboricCellSim + TopologicalMorphogenesisSim
    morphogenesis       Run TopologicalMorphogenesisSim only
    telomeres           Show full telomere subsystem state
    status              Show simulation results and reports
    list                List all exported symbols
    info                Show available tools (alias for list)
    help                Show this help message

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --file FILE, -f FILE  Input file (JSON or FASTA/sequence)
  --stdin, -i           Read JSON arguments from stdin
